msgid "Manage those lists, and set these details on any product, without being able to change its price, status or tax status. A deposit set on a product is added to what customers pay at checkout, and getting legal details wrong has legal consequences, so changes to products and deposits and every deletion need explicit confirmation."
msgstr ""

